id: pm-gh1481
title: "GH-1481: Agent UX: pm list --sort <field> omits the sort key from the brief projection"
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1481. An explicit list sort makes its sort key visible in the implicit brief projection, while explicit requested fields remain authoritative."
